    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-4-sec-3-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3(1) Objects—general" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The objects of this Act are to give the Australian community access to information held by the Government of the Commonwealth, by: (a) requiring agencies to publish the information; and (b) providing for a right of access to documents." ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-3-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3(2) Objects—general"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-3-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Parliament intends, by these objects, to promote Australia’s representative democracy by contributing towards the following: (a) increasing public participation in Government processes, with a view to promoting better-informed decision-making; (b) increasing scrutiny, discussion, comment and review of the Government’s activities." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Parliament intends, by these objects, to promote Australia’s representative democracy by contributing towards the following: (a) increasing public participation in Government processes, with a view to promoting better-informed decision-making; (b) increasing scrutiny, discussion, comment and review of the Government’s activities."@en ;
