rliament; (i) contact details for an officer (or officers) who can be contacted about access to the agency’s information or documents under this Act; (j) the agency’s operational information (see section 8A). Note: If operational information is not published in accordance with this section, a person must not be subjected to any prejudice as a result (see section 10)." ;
