concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-11c-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11C(3) Publication of information in accessed documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-11c-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The agency, or the Minister, must publish the information to members of the public generally on a website by: (a) making the information available for downloading from the website; or (b) publishing on the website a link to another website, from which the information can be downloaded; or   Access to documents  Part III  Section 12 Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026 (c) publishing on the website other details of how the information may be obtained." ;
