concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-11c-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11C(7) Publication of information in accessed documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-11c-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) In this section: working day means a day that is not: (a) a Saturday; or (b) a Sunday; or (c) a public holiday in the place where the function of publishing the information under this section is to be performed." ;
    skos:definition "(7) In this section: working day means a day that is not: (a) a Saturday; or (b) a Sunday; or (c) a public holiday in the place where the function of publishing the information under this section is to be performed."@en ;
