concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-16-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16(4) Transfer of requests"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-16-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Where a request is transferred to an agency in accordance with this section, the agency making the transfer shall inform the person making the request accordingly and, if it is necessary to do so in order to enable the other agency to deal with the request, send the document to the other agency." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Where a request is transferred to an agency in accordance with this section, the agency making the transfer shall inform the person making the request accordingly and, if it is necessary to do so in order to enable the other agency to deal with the request, send the document to the other agency."@en ;
