doc:sch-4-sec-20-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20(3) Forms of access" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the giving of access in the form requested by the applicant: (a) would interfere unreasonably with the operations of the agency, or the performance by the Minister of his or her functions, as the case may be; (b) would be detrimental to the preservation of the document or, having regard to the physical nature of the document, would not be appropriate; or (c) would, but for this Act, involve an infringement of copyright (other than copyright owned by the Commonwealth, an agency or a State) subsisting in matter contained in the document, being matter that does not relate to the affairs of an agency or of a Department of State; access in that form may be refused and access given in another form." ;
    cof:pageNumber "66"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-20-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20(4) Forms of access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-20-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Subject to subsection 17(1), where a person requests access to a document in a particular form and, for a reason specified in subsection (3), access in that form is refused but access is given in another form, the applicant shall not be required to pay a charge in respect of the provision of access to the document that is greater than the charge that he or she would have been required to pay if access had been given in the form requested." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Subject to subsection 17(1), where a person requests access to a document in a particular form and, for a reason specified in subsection (3), access in that form is refused but access is given in another form, the applicant shall not be required to pay a charge in respect of the provision of access to the document that is greater than the charge that he or she would have been required to pay if access had been given in the form requested."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3547c56c6986c08be9adcd55a1fa04c256249c13bd4a5984d8caffa854321a70" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-20 ;
    cof:pageNumber "66"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Applicant shall not be required to pay a charge greater than what they would have paid if access was given in the requested form." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
