doc:sch-4-sec-20-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20(4) Forms of access" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) Subject to subsection 17(1), where a person requests access to a document in a particular form and, for a reason specified in subsection (3), access in that form is refused but access is given in another form, the applicant shall not be required to pay a charge in respect of the provision of access to the document that is greater than the charge that he or she would have been required to pay if access had been given in the form requested." ;
