doc:sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "24AB(3) What is a request consultation process?" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the applicant contacts the contact person during the consultation period in accordance with the notice, the agency or Minister must take reasonable steps to assist the applicant to revise the request so that the practical refusal reason no longer exists." ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24AB(4) What is a request consultation process?"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), reasonable steps includes the following:   Access to documents  Part III  Section 24AB Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026 (a) giving the applicant a reasonable opportunity to consult with the contact person; (b) providing the applicant with any information that would assist the applicant to revise the request. Extension of consultation period" ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), reasonable steps includes the following:   Access to documents  Part III  Section 24AB Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026 (a) giving the applicant a reasonable opportunity to consult with the contact person; (b) providing the applicant with any information that would assist the applicant to revise the request. Extension of consultation period"@en ;
