doc:sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "24AB(4) What is a request consultation process?" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), reasonable steps includes the following:   Access to documents  Part III  Section 24AB Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026 (a) giving the applicant a reasonable opportunity to consult with the contact person; (b) providing the applicant with any information that would assist the applicant to revise the request. Extension of consultation period" ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24AB(5) What is a request consultation process?"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The contact person may, with the applicant’s agreement, extend the consultation period by written notice to the applicant. Outcome of request consultation process" ;
