doc:sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "24AB(7) What is a request consultation process?" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) The request is taken to have been withdrawn under subsection (6) at the end of the consultation period if: (a) the applicant does not consult the contact person during the consultation period in accordance with the notice; or (b) the applicant does not do one of the things mentioned in subsection (6) before the end of the consultation period. Consultation period to be disregarded in calculating processing period" ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24AB(8) What is a request consultation process?"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-24ab-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) The period starting on the day an applicant is given a notice under subsection (2) and ending on the day the applicant does one of the things mentioned in paragraph (6)(b) or (c) is to be disregarded in working out the 30 day period mentioned in paragraph 15(5)(b). Note: Paragraph 15(5)(b) requires that an agency or Minister take all reasonable steps to notify an applicant of a decision on the applicant’s request within 30 days after the request is made." ;
    skos:definition "(8) The period starting on the day an applicant is given a notice under subsection (2) and ending on the day the applicant does one of the things mentioned in paragraph (6)(b) or (c) is to be disregarded in working out the 30 day period mentioned in paragraph 15(5)(b). Note: Paragraph 15(5)(b) requires that an agency or Minister take all reasonable steps to notify an applicant of a decision on the applicant’s request within 30 days after the request is made."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "08130a261bad667bac3ae9931246bc91cee543a0165e305d9fd2b555494117bf" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-24ab ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Agency or Minister must notify applicant of decision within 30 days after request is made." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.72" ;
