    skos:definition "(1) Nothing in this Act shall be taken to require an agency or Minister to give information as to the existence or non-existence of a document where information as to the existence or non-existence of that document, if included in a document of an agency, would cause the last-mentioned document to be:   Access to documents  Part III  Section 26 Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026 (a) an exempt document by virtue of section 33 or subsection 37(1) or 45A(1); or (b) an exempt document to the extent referred to in subsection 45A(2) or (3)."@en ;
