concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-31a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31A Access to exempt and conditionally exempt documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-31a ;
    values:originalText "The following table summarises how this Act applies to exempt documents and documents that are conditionally exempt: How this Act applies to exempt and conditionally exempt documents Item If … then … because of … a document is an exempt document under Division 2 (exemptions) or under paragraph (b) or (c) of the definition of exempt document in subsection 4(1) access to the document is not required to be given subsection 11A(4). a document is a conditionally exempt document under" ;
    skos:definition "The following table summarises how this Act applies to exempt documents and documents that are conditionally exempt: How this Act applies to exempt and conditionally exempt documents Item If … then … because of … a document is an exempt document under Division 2 (exemptions) or under paragraph (b) or (c) of the definition of exempt document in subsection 4(1) access to the document is not required to be given subsection 11A(4). a document is a conditionally exempt document under"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5f98c47043bb3b212741695f9f4ed7ffc79af92e2f656e5b2c73fd11071aa2ae" ;
