doc:sch-4-sec-50-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "50(3) Amendment of records" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) To the extent that it is practicable to do so, the agency or Minister must, when making an amendment under paragraph (2)(a), ensure that the record of information is amended in a way that does not   Amendment and annotation of personal records  Part V  Section 51 Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026 obliterate the text of the record as it existed prior to the amendment." ;
