concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-53c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53C Internal review—who is an affected third party?"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-53c ;
    values:originalText "(1) The following table has effect: Who is an affected third party? Item If, in relation to a request for access to a document ... the affected third party for the document is ... consultation with a State under section 26A (documents affecting Commonwealth-State relations etc.) is required the State. section 27 (business documents) applies in relation to business information in the document the person or organisation concerned (within the meaning of section 27). section 27A (documents affecting personal privacy) applies in relation to personal information in the document about a living person the person." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The following table has effect: Who is an affected third party? Item If, in relation to a request for access to a document ... the affected third party for the document is ... consultation with a State under section 26A (documents affecting Commonwealth-State relations etc.) is required the State. section 27 (business documents) applies in relation to business information in the document the person or organisation concerned (within the meaning of section 27). section 27A (documents affecting personal privacy) applies in relation to personal information in the document about a living person the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6554729ba5b005a8b5328071d24246a8a8f19aef7f4f3dc1871a794d35737eef" ;
    cof:pageNumber "121"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines who is an affected third party for a document request." ;
