concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54D(6) Internal review—deemed affirmation of original decision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-54d-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Subsection (2) (deemed affirmation) does not apply, and is taken never to have applied, if the agency: (a) makes a decision on the application within the further time allowed; and (b) complies with any condition imposed under subsection (5)." ;
