concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54D(7) Internal review—deemed affirmation of original decision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-54d-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) However, subsection (2) (deemed affirmation) applies as if the initial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the Information Commissioner under subsection (4) if the agency: (a) does not make a decision on the request within the further time allowed; or (b) does not comply with any condition imposed under subsection (5). No further time allowed" ;
    skos:definition "(7) However, subsection (2) (deemed affirmation) applies as if the initial decision period were extended by the time allowed by the Information Commissioner under subsection (4) if the agency: (a) does not make a decision on the request within the further time allowed; or (b) does not comply with any condition imposed under subsection (5). No further time allowed"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "faaa88c9d8c01887c004f79d5e8e0e0bd59ac07da696ba18d79a285f3999b525" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54d ;
    cof:pageNumber "124"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No further time allowed after agency fails to comply with conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
