concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54m-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54M(2) IC reviewable decisions—access grant decisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-54m-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) This subsection covers the following decisions: (a) an access grant decision; (b) a decision made by an agency on internal review of an access grant decision (see section 54C). Note: If no decision is made on internal review within 30 days, a decision to affirm the original access grant decision is taken to have been made (see section 54D)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) This subsection covers the following decisions: (a) an access grant decision; (b) a decision made by an agency on internal review of an access grant decision (see section 54C). Note: If no decision is made on internal review within 30 days, a decision to affirm the original access grant decision is taken to have been made (see section 54D)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "28b6ce784d2b023474df7a2f52083d2dfb4ff094c7312910a19515d4f8ecc762" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54m ;
    cof:pageNumber "129"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Decision to affirm original access grant decision if no internal review decision within 30 days" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
