doc:sch-4-sec-54x-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "54X(3) Decision to review—notice requirement if discretion not to" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The notice must: (a) state the reasons for the Information Commissioner’s decision; and (b) if the Information Commissioner makes a decision under paragraph 54W(b)—state that an application for review of the relevant IC reviewable decision may be made to the Tribunal under section 57A. Note: See section 57A for the time within which the application for review must be made to the Tribunal." ;
    cof:pageNumber "137"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-54x-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54X(4) Decision to review—notice requirement if discretion not to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-54x-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, the notice must not include: (a) exempt matter; or (b) information of the kind referred to in subsection 25(1). Note: Subsection 25(1) deals with information about the existence or otherwise of certain documents." ;
    skos:definition "(4) However, the notice must not include: (a) exempt matter; or (b) information of the kind referred to in subsection 25(1). Note: Subsection 25(1) deals with information about the existence or otherwise of certain documents."@en ;
