doc:sch-4-sec-55e-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "55E(3) Procedure in IC review—inadequate reasons from decision" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the Information Commissioner gives notice under subsection (2), the agency or Minister must provide the adequate statement of reasons to the IC review applicant and the Information Commissioner within: (a) the period specified in the notice; or (b) if no period is specified in the notice—28 days after the day the notice was given to the agency or Minister." ;
