concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55F Procedure in IC review—review parties reach agreement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55f ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if, at any stage of an IC review: (a) the review parties reach agreement as to the terms of a decision on an IC review: (i) on the IC review application; or (ii) in relation to a part of the IC review application; or (iii) in relation to a matter arising out of the IC review application; and (b) the agreement is acceptable to all of the review parties; and" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if, at any stage of an IC review: (a) the review parties reach agreement as to the terms of a decision on an IC review: (i) on the IC review application; or (ii) in relation to a part of the IC review application; or (iii) in relation to a matter arising out of the IC review application; and (b) the agreement is acceptable to all of the review parties; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ecb6d1584fcc10bfc04c24a97013e5535182e2b0423cf12e2e1ea240820c0a79" ;
    cof:pageNumber "143"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Review parties must agree on terms of a decision in IC review" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
