concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55p-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55P(4) Decision on IC review—enforcement of decision against agency"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55p-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An application under subsection (1) may only be made if: (a) the time has ended for making an application to the Tribunal under section 57A for review of the Information Commissioner’s decision; and (b) such an application is not made before the end of the time." ;
    skos:definition "(4) An application under subsection (1) may only be made if: (a) the time has ended for making an application to the Tribunal under section 57A for review of the Information Commissioner’s decision; and (b) such an application is not made before the end of the time."@en ;
