concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55y a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55Y Information gathering powers—no loss of legal professional"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55y ;
    values:originalText "privilege Information or a document does not cease to be the subject of legal professional privilege merely because it is given, provided, produced or referred to for the purposes of this Part.   Review by Information Commissioner  Part VII Information gathering powers  Division 8 Section 55Z Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026" ;
    skos:definition "privilege Information or a document does not cease to be the subject of legal professional privilege merely because it is given, provided, produced or referred to for the purposes of this Part.   Review by Information Commissioner  Part VII Information gathering powers  Division 8 Section 55Z Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "20d08beb303aa40ad4fa207eca5e1ad5e42e7c62ae6d9d44e9f8b9de3b8fb7ad" ;
    cof:pageNumber "156"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No loss of legal professional privilege when information is given, produced or referred to for the purposes of this Part." ;
