concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55ZD(2) Evidence by Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General to take possession of, and make copies of or take extracts from, any document given to the Information Commissioner for the purposes of the proceeding." ;
