concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55ZD(3) Evidence by Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Inspector-General may require the production of the following: (a) the document that is claimed to be an exempt document under section 33 by the agency to which or the Minister to whom the request was made for access to the document; (b) any document of an agency or official document of a Minister that relates to the document mentioned in subsection (2) by the agency or Minister." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Inspector-General may require the production of the following: (a) the document that is claimed to be an exempt document under section 33 by the agency to which or the Minister to whom the request was made for access to the document; (b) any document of an agency or official document of a Minister that relates to the document mentioned in subsection (2) by the agency or Minister."@en ;
