concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55ZD(8) Evidence by Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-55zd-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General a period within which to consider the documents mentioned in subsections (2) to (4) that is reasonable having regard to: (a) the nature of the evidence that the Inspector-General has been requested to give; and (b) the time required by the Inspector-General to perform the Inspector-General’s other functions." ;
    skos:definition "(8) The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General a period within which to consider the documents mentioned in subsections (2) to (4) that is reasonable having regard to: (a) the nature of the evidence that the Inspector-General has been requested to give; and (b) the time required by the Inspector-General to perform the Inspector-General’s other functions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "742021bd340727a962153d279c8abb6b54023ec3d259310d2b1f7f29af52c58a" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-55zd ;
    cof:pageNumber "160"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Information Commissioner must allow the Inspector-General a reasonable time to consider documents." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
