concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-66-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "66(3) Tribunal may make recommendation that costs be available in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-66-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The responsible Minister may, pursuant to a recommendation of the Tribunal under subsection (1), authorize the payment of costs to an applicant.   Review by the Tribunal  Part VIIA Automatic stay of certain decisions  Division 7 Section 67 Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The responsible Minister may, pursuant to a recommendation of the Tribunal under subsection (1), authorize the payment of costs to an applicant.   Review by the Tribunal  Part VIIA Automatic stay of certain decisions  Division 7 Section 67 Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026"@en ;
