concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-68 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "68 Investigations and complaints—guide"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-68 ;
    values:originalText "This Part is about investigations by the Information Commissioner and by the Ombudsman. Division 2 sets up a system for investigations by the Information Commissioner. The Information Commissioner may investigate an action taken by an agency in the performance of functions or the exercise of powers under this Act on a complaint from a person, or on the Information Commissioner’s initiative. If a person disputes the merits of an access refusal decision or an access grant decision, this Act provides elsewhere for the review of that decision (see Parts VI, VII and VIIA). However, this does not prevent a person from making a complaint to the Information Commissioner about the way in which the agency has handled the decision. The Information Commissioner has powers to obtain documents, to question persons and to enter premises (see Subdivision D of" ;
    skos:definition "This Part is about investigations by the Information Commissioner and by the Ombudsman. Division 2 sets up a system for investigations by the Information Commissioner. The Information Commissioner may investigate an action taken by an agency in the performance of functions or the exercise of powers under this Act on a complaint from a person, or on the Information Commissioner’s initiative. If a person disputes the merits of an access refusal decision or an access grant decision, this Act provides elsewhere for the review of that decision (see Parts VI, VII and VIIA). However, this does not prevent a person from making a complaint to the Information Commissioner about the way in which the agency has handled the decision. The Information Commissioner has powers to obtain documents, to question persons and to enter premises (see Subdivision D of"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "abc5f3739c8fbbb83b67b45517eeb2ac8e339bb83d778dcf6564960a830fd2b6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "187"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Information Commissioner may investigate an action taken by an agency." ;
