concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-71 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "71 Information Commissioner investigations—interpretation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-71 ;
    values:originalText "This Subdivision applies to a part of a complaint as if: (a) a reference to a complaint were a reference to the part of the complaint; and (b) a reference to an action were a reference to an action to which the part of the complaint relates." ;
    skos:definition "This Subdivision applies to a part of a complaint as if: (a) a reference to a complaint were a reference to the part of the complaint; and (b) a reference to an action were a reference to an action to which the part of the complaint relates."@en ;
