concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-80 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80 Information Commissioner investigations—dealings with"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-80 ;
    values:originalText "documents What the Information Commissioner may do with documents (1) The Information Commissioner may do one or more of the following with respect to any documents produced in accordance with a notice under subsection 79(3): (a) take possession of the documents; (b) make copies of the documents; (c) take extracts from the documents; (d) hold the documents for a period that is necessary for the purposes of the investigation." ;
    skos:definition "documents What the Information Commissioner may do with documents (1) The Information Commissioner may do one or more of the following with respect to any documents produced in accordance with a notice under subsection 79(3): (a) take possession of the documents; (b) make copies of the documents; (c) take extracts from the documents; (d) hold the documents for a period that is necessary for the purposes of the investigation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2a06cc307a916abce020de26ffbea94d69659db3ff73ba41b17f73827a9f732a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "197"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Information Commissioner may take possession, make copies, extracts, or hold documents for investigation purposes." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.197" ;
    cml:asserts concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-80-norm .
