concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-84 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "84 Information Commissioner investigations—no loss of legal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-84 ;
    values:originalText "professional privilege Information or a document does not cease to be the subject of legal professional privilege merely because it is given, provided, produced or referred to for the purposes of this Part." ;
