doc:sch-4-sec-89g a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "89G Complaints to Ombudsman—report must not contain certain" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "information A report under subsection 12(3) or section 15 or 17 of the Ombudsman Act 1976 in relation to an action taken under this Act must not include: (a) exempt matter; or (b) information of the kind referred to in subsection 25(1). Note: Subsection 25(1) deals with information about the existence or otherwise of certain documents." ;
    cof:pageNumber "207"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "89H Complaints to Ombudsman—certain rights not affected by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-89h ;
    values:originalText "certificates (1) This section applies if: (a) the Ombudsman has commenced an investigation of a decision made under this Act not to grant a request for access to a document; and (b) the Attorney-General furnishes a certificate to the Ombudsman under paragraph 9(3)(a), (c) or (d) of the Ombudsman Act 1976 in relation to that investigation. (2) The certificate does not affect the Ombudsman’s right to: (a) seek from any person the reasons for a decision made under this Act not to give access to an exempt document; or (b) require any person to give any information or to answer any questions concerning the decision." ;
    skos:definition "certificates (1) This section applies if: (a) the Ombudsman has commenced an investigation of a decision made under this Act not to grant a request for access to a document; and (b) the Attorney-General furnishes a certificate to the Ombudsman under paragraph 9(3)(a), (c) or (d) of the Ombudsman Act 1976 in relation to that investigation. (2) The certificate does not affect the Ombudsman’s right to: (a) seek from any person the reasons for a decision made under this Act not to give access to an exempt document; or (b) require any person to give any information or to answer any questions concerning the decision."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f78c06aa55a0e2d18b5653884184079a5e77f231af10d7cbdc121b5cb40ef187" ;
    cof:pageNumber "207"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89h-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-89h-ss-2 ;
