    cof:title "90(1) Protection against civil liability—general" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) No action for defamation, breach of confidence or infringement of copyright lies against the Commonwealth, a Minister, an agency or an officer of an agency because the Minister, or an officer of the agency: (a) publishes a document in good faith, in the belief that the publication is required or permitted under Part II (information publication scheme) or section 11C (publication of information in accessed documents); or (b) gives access to a document in good faith, in the belief that the access is required or permitted to be given in response to a request; or (c) publishes, or gives access to, a document in good faith, in the belief that the publication or access is required or permitted otherwise than under this Act (whether or not under an express legislative power)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "212"^^xsd:integer .

concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-90-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "90(2) Protection against civil liability—general"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-90-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) No action for defamation, or breach of confidence, in respect of the publication of a document covered by subsection (3), lies against a person (including the author of the document) because the person supplied the document to a Minister or an agency." ;
    skos:definition "(2) No action for defamation, or breach of confidence, in respect of the publication of a document covered by subsection (3), lies against a person (including the author of the document) because the person supplied the document to a Minister or an agency."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1d87e85efc0ce7280e9450ea7b12e4ba4e392c1f6e93027e9bf63bced5e93152" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-90 ;
    cof:pageNumber "212"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No action for defamation or breach of confidence against a person supplying a document to a Minister or agency." ;
