    skos:prefLabel "90(3) Protection against civil liability—general"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-90-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The publication of a document is covered by this subsection if: (a) it is published as mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (c); or   Miscellaneous  Part VIII General  Division 2 Section 91 Freedom of Information Act 1982 Compilation date: 01/01/2026 (b) its publication is involved in, or results from, the giving of access to the document (or another document) as mentioned in paragraph (1)(b) or (c)." ;
