concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-94-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "94(2) Regulations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-94-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting the generality of subsection (1), regulations under that subsection making provision for or in relation to the making of charges: (a) shall not be such that the amount or rate of charge varies according to whether a document is a document of one agency or of an agency included in one class of agency or is a document of another agency or of an agency included in another class of agency; (b) shall, if a charge is made for time that is spent by an agency or a Minister in undertaking any of the following activities: (i) searching for or retrieving a document;" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Without limiting the generality of subsection (1), regulations under that subsection making provision for or in relation to the making of charges: (a) shall not be such that the amount or rate of charge varies according to whether a document is a document of one agency or of an agency included in one class of agency or is a document of another agency or of an agency included in another class of agency; (b) shall, if a charge is made for time that is spent by an agency or a Minister in undertaking any of the following activities: (i) searching for or retrieving a document;"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "89430a6f4e788ea8fc17f7fd6a9f7158fd27873c1716eda8025bb806756b66e2" ;
    values:partOf concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-94 ;
    cof:pageNumber "217"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Regulations cannot vary charge amounts based on agency or class of agency." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf> ;
    dc:source "freedom-of-information-act-1982.pdf, p.217" ;
